                "The simplest registration request uses the following defaults.\n- `years` defaults to the extension's minimum registration period (typically 1 year).\n- `auto_renew` defaults to `false`.\n- `privacy_mode` defaults to `redaction`.\n- Registrant contact falls back to the account's default address book entry.\n",
